      "content": "the throat thing is actually getting pretty scary. it feels like it's getting harder to breathe every few minutes and my tongue feels kind of puffy too. if i take the 25mg and it doesn't work immediately, how long do i actually have to wait before i should call 911? i'm really worried that if i wait too long, i'll pass out. is there like a specific sign that means it's officially an emergency?",
